  "description": "Garett is just a wanderer and an opportunist traveling from village to village, looking for an easy payday. One day, he meets the mysterious half-elf bard, Sonnet, and his life starts getting…interesting. She knows the lay of the land, lyrics to every song, and seems much more powerful than she’s letting on… Will their mission for gold and riches turn fruitful or sour? Magic, mystery, treasure and treachery awaits in “Deus Bard Machina”!",
